<section class="reference-section" id="kartikeya-birth"><div class="reference-section-heading"><h2>The Birth of Kartikeya</h2><a href="/kartikeya-birth.html">Return to story</a></div><div class="reference-content">
<p><strong>Shiva Mahapurana · Rudra Samhita · Kumara Khanda · chapters 1–5.</strong> This original condensed English retelling follows the owner-supplied Gita Press Sanskrit–Hindi edition (private PDF pages 743–769; printed pages 733–759). Chapter structure and narrative details were checked against J. L. Shastri’s English translation. The supplied PDF is not copied into the public site or repository.</p>
